## 🎯 RBAC Quick Reference

### Role Hierarchy

```
user < viewer < editor < approver < admin < superadmin
```

### Permissions Matrix

| Action       | User | Viewer | Editor | Approver | Admin | Superadmin |
| ------------ | ---- | ------ | ------ | -------- | ----- | ---------- |
| View CMS     | ❌   | ✅     | ✅     | ✅       | ✅    | ✅         |
| Create/Edit  | ❌   | ❌     | ✅     | ✅       | ✅    | ✅         |
