## 📊 Performance Tips

### Image Loading Optimization

```tsx
// Use progressive loading
<div>
  {/* 1. BlurHash (< 1kb) */}
  <div style={{ backgroundImage: `url(${blurHash})` }} />
  
  {/* 2. Thumbnail (< 50kb) */}
  <img src={thumbnailUrl} className="blur-sm" />
  
  {/* 3. Full image (lazy) */}
  <img 
    src={originalUrl} 
    loading="lazy"
    onLoad={() => setLoaded(true)}
  />
</div>
```

### Batch Fetching

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: Fetch batch of 10
