| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ------ | ------ |
| 🔴 P0    | #2 Prisma disconnect audit         | Low    | High   |
| 🔴 P0    | #3 Remove static data files        | Medium | High   |
| 🔴 P0    | #4 Input validation                | Medium | High   |
| 🔴 P1    | #1 Service file consolidation      | High   | High   |
