5. VERIFY optimizer uses ReviewLog
   - Modify: lib/fsrs-optimizer.ts to query ReviewLog instead of UserProgress
   - Test with: npm run optimize-params -- --user-id <test-user>
   
6. DEPRECATE UserProgress.reviewHistory (do NOT remove yet)
   - Add migration marker: reviewHistoryMigrated: Boolean @default(false)
   - Keep for rollback safety
   
PERFORMANCE EXPECTATIONS:

Before (UserProgress.reviewHistory as Json[]):
  - Query 1000 reviews: ~500ms (full table scan)
  - Filter by date range: NOT POSSIBLE (Json array)
  - Join with MedicalContent: NOT POSSIBLE
  - Index usage: NONE
  
After (ReviewLog with composite indexes):
  - Query 1000 reviews: ~5ms (index scan)
