  - Join with MedicalContent: ~8ms (indexed join)
  - Index usage: 100%
  
Expected speedup: 100x for FSRS optimization queries

CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS (Edge Runtime):
  - All queries MUST use Prisma Accelerate connection pooling
  - No raw SQL (not supported in Cloudflare Pages)
  - Batch operations: max 1000 records per transaction
  - Keep migrations reversible for 7-day rollback window
