#!/usr/bin/env npx tsx
/**
 * CT Image Fetcher - Specialized Script
 *
 * Fetches CT scan images from Wikimedia Commons for PA student visual diagnosis training.
 *
 * CT Adequacy Criteria:
 * - Must be actual CT image (not diagram/illustration)
