      'FENa = [(Urine Na × Serum Cr) / (Serum Na × Urine Cr)] × 100 = [(12 × 2.1) / (142 × 180)] × 100 = 0.36%. FENa <1% suggests pre-renal AKI (volume depletion in this case).',
    calculationHint: 'FENa = [(UNa × SCr) / (SNa × UCr)] × 100',
