      'Using 4-2-1 rule: First 10 kg = 4 mL/kg/hr = 40 mL/hr. Next 10 kg = 2 mL/kg/hr = 20 mL/hr. Remaining 5 kg = 1 mL/kg/hr = 5 mL/hr. Total = 65 mL/hr.',
