/**
 * Unified User Analytics Service
 *
 * FORTRESS MODE: Consolidated analytics entry point (Phase 6)
 *
 * Merges functionality from:
 * - advancedUserAnalyticsEngine.ts (cognitive state, learning velocity, FSRS)
